WEBVTT

00:36:57.853 --> 00:37:00.045
of the right kind.

00:37:00.069 --> 00:37:02.800
Do you see any scenario

00:37:02.824 --> 00:37:05.898
where the US and China
really feel that they're getting benefit

00:37:05.922 --> 00:37:09.688
from each other's AI development,

00:37:09.712 --> 00:37:14.587
and actually, some of the edge and fear
comes out of that competition,

00:37:14.611 --> 00:37:17.761
or is this going to be
kind of a bloodbath, essentially?

00:37:18.452 --> 00:37:20.254
KFL: I'm still an optimist,

00:37:20.278 --> 00:37:24.059
because I think the companies
are working together,

00:37:24.083 --> 00:37:27.169
the researchers are working together,

00:37:27.193 --> 00:37:31.760
ideas are being shared
from new technologies.